   "source": [
    "## Fitting the model\n",
    "\n",
    "We fit an ordinary least squares line, minimising\n",
    "\n",
    "$$L(\\beta) = \\sum_i (y_i - \\beta_0 - \\beta_1 x_i)^2$$\n",
    "\n",
    "and report $R^2$ alongside the residual standard error.\n"
   ]
  },
